{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 FrogShot</strong> is a platformer game that introduces a new way of moving around - with your tongue!\ud83d\udc45   <br><br>Get freaky and use it as:<br>- a grappling hook to gain momentum to get anywhere you want! <br>- to slingshot yourself across the map!<br>-  to control mechanisms: lick a button or two!<br>- move around by sticking your tongue into the ground, walls and many other crevices!<br>- leap  by launching yourself off the ground! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the silly lookin frog through various dangers in unique worlds and enjoy your one handed gameplay. Each world offers you a core mechanic and 3 side ones. Brace yourself as the difficulty level rises and put your coordination and reflexes to test while <strong>YOU </strong>struggle to eat buzzing flies and finish levels as fast as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>McFrog Station</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture into a sci-fi space station - go two handed mode and bend gravity to your will while dodging deadly lasers trying to keep you away from your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.poster.avif?t=1762100845\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.webm?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.mp4?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Icy Mountains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy frost covered world with an occasional snow storm throwing you off your game, alongside slippery ice-floor, tricky teleporters and icicles trying to turn you into popsicle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.poster.avif?t=1762100845\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.webm?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.mp4?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Abandoned Factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face new challenges with your trusty compressor pack \u2014 let the pressure carry you through danger. But be careful: faster isn\u2019t always better. Will you escape, or end up as a pancake on the autonomous belts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.poster.avif?t=1762100845\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.webm?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.mp4?t=1762100845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark Caverns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Penetrate deep caverns with